{"3640550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Earnest Evans Collection", "steam_appid": 3640550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Earnest Evans Collection is a collection of three classic games from the famed developers at Wolf Team (who would go on to create the famed <i>Tales of</i> RPG series): <i>Earnest Evans, El Viento</i>, and <i>Annet Returns</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/274364b2d1ad0cc760b36b43ca3c2824.avif?t=1773306473\" width=900 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Earnest Evans:</strong> President Calvin Coolidge has hired famed adventurer Earnest Evans to find and locate an ancient grimoire - The Necronomicon. Unbeknownst to Earnest Evans, someone else has their eyes on it: Al Capone! Al Capone hopes to use the book to resurrect the Dark Lord Hastur and control Europe unless Earnest and a young priestess named Annet can stop him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/d22e1e655f9e09ac445fc81d9c5f29c9.avif?t=1773306473\" width=900 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>El Viento:</strong> Several years after the events of Earnest Evans, Al Capone and a sorceress named Restiana are continuing a plot to revive the Dark Lord Hastur. It has been learned that Annet descended from Hastur's bloodline, and her blood alone can resurrect him. With assistance from Earnest Evans, Annet embarks on a journey to stop Al Capone's plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/82d114800f4a1bf841cb6a114d2d7d33.avif?t=1773306473\" width=900 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Annet Returns:</strong> The exciting conclusion to this trilogy of games. Annet travels across Europe on a quest to protect the world from certain destruction at the hands of Siegfried Munchausen and the evil NeXesis Party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/828c818654c4ad43b1738478240344c7.poster.avif?t=1773306473\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/828c818654c4ad43b1738478240344c7.webm?t=1773306473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/828c818654c4ad43b1738478240344c7.mp4?t=1773306473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible animated cutscenes in Earnest Evans and Annet Returns from the masterminds at MADHOUSE (<i>Trigun, Cardcaptor Sakura</i>, and more).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masterful soundtrack from acclaimed video game composer Motoi Sakuraba (<i>Star Ocean, Tales of Phantasia, Mario Golf, Valkyrie Profile</i>, and more).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes both the CD and cartridge versions of Earnest Evans (both of which had different stories).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind any time - with the simple press of a button, you can undo any mistakes you make in gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save anywhere - you can save your progress at any moment from the in-game menu.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Earnest Evans Collection is a collection of three classic games from the famed developers at Wolf Team (who would go on to create the famed <i>Tales of</i> RPG series): <i>Earnest Evans, El Viento</i>, and <i>Annet Returns</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/274364b2d1ad0cc760b36b43ca3c2824.avif?t=1773306473\" width=900 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Earnest Evans:</strong> President Calvin Coolidge has hired famed adventurer Earnest Evans to find and locate an ancient grimoire - The Necronomicon. Unbeknownst to Earnest Evans, someone else has their eyes on it: Al Capone! Al Capone hopes to use the book to resurrect the Dark Lord Hastur and control Europe unless Earnest and a young priestess named Annet can stop him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/d22e1e655f9e09ac445fc81d9c5f29c9.avif?t=1773306473\" width=900 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>El Viento:</strong> Several years after the events of Earnest Evans, Al Capone and a sorceress named Restiana are continuing a plot to revive the Dark Lord Hastur. It has been learned that Annet descended from Hastur's bloodline, and her blood alone can resurrect him. With assistance from Earnest Evans, Annet embarks on a journey to stop Al Capone's plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/82d114800f4a1bf841cb6a114d2d7d33.avif?t=1773306473\" width=900 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Annet Returns:</strong> The exciting conclusion to this trilogy of games. Annet travels across Europe on a quest to protect the world from certain destruction at the hands of Siegfried Munchausen and the evil NeXesis Party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/828c818654c4ad43b1738478240344c7.poster.avif?t=1773306473\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/828c818654c4ad43b1738478240344c7.webm?t=1773306473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/extras/828c818654c4ad43b1738478240344c7.mp4?t=1773306473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible animated cutscenes in Earnest Evans and Annet Returns from the masterminds at MADHOUSE (<i>Trigun, Cardcaptor Sakura</i>, and more).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masterful soundtrack from acclaimed video game composer Motoi Sakuraba (<i>Star Ocean, Tales of Phantasia, Mario Golf, Valkyrie Profile</i>, and more).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes both the CD and cartridge versions of Earnest Evans (both of which had different stories).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind any time - with the simple press of a button, you can undo any mistakes you make in gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save anywhere - you can save your progress at any moment from the in-game menu.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Three classic action games return in the Earnest Evans Collection: Earnest Evans, El Viento, and Anett Returns! Can you put an end to Al Capone's evil plans and thwart the resurrection of the Dark Lord Hastur?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/5eb7ca6a2e330129020b4d1349fdc9626aff2e6b/header.jpg?t=1773306473", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/40de17217e2d5a40eead7b41980d685b025545ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773306473", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640550/40de17217e2d5a40eead7b41980d685b025545ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773306473", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u